<title>HONG KONG: Cosco Pacific shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Cosco Pacific shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Cosco Pacific Ltd have been suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said on Monday morning.  </p>
<p>Cosco Pacific, which will announce its 1996 earnings later on Monday, will hold a briefing on the results at 0930 GMT.</p>
<p>It also was expected to announce plans to buy certain China port terminals from its parent COSCO (Hong Kong) Group Ltd, analysts said.</p>
<p>The company is forecast to report earnings of HK$561 million in 1996, an increase of 55 percent over the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6933</p>
